abstract: >-
  A native Swift and Metal runtime for local Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B Q4
  mixture-of-experts inference on Apple Silicon, using bounded active-expert
  streaming and a native macOS chat interface.
keywords:
  - "Qwen 3.6"
  - "large language model inference"
  - "mixture of experts"
  - "Apple Silicon"
  - "Metal"
  - "Swift"
  - "on-device AI"
  - "active-expert streaming"
